<title>USA: Arlington, Texas, $6.900 mln won by Prudential.</title>
<headline>Arlington, Texas, $6.900 mln won by Prudential.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities said it won $6.900 million of Arlington, Texas, combination tax and revenue limited tax certificates of obligation, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.04 percent.</p>
</text>
